    {
      "id": "P4B2rFwcLTDOVoXvbDfmJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 886.8949345059201,
      "y": 800.2995690947688,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "an",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1198248740,
      "version": 279,
      "versionNonce": 1458078756,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783309164427,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "就是像是人脑在地图上把这个画出来，然后做一下标记，这样就能一直去尝试尝试不同的路",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "就是像是人脑在地图上把这个画出来，然后做一下标记，这样就能一直去尝试尝试不同的路",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2w9ZynHXpv_EK526j9YDb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 887.6794702069068,
      "y": 847.4385892385019,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ao",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1760348452,
      "version": 349,
      "versionNonce": 1873668132,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783309157702,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果走到尽头就退回去重新试，直到不停地重复这个流程，直到找到最后的出口，这就可以写成一个程式",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果走到尽头就退回去重新试，直到不停地重复这个流程，直到找到最后的出口，这就可以写成一个程式",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
